WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.320 --> 00:00:03.980
- Is it weird, Sasquatch,
to have people who have kids

00:00:03.980 --> 00:00:06.110
now tell you they loved you in "The OC?"

00:00:06.110 --> 00:00:07.487
You were great in "The OC."

00:00:09.950 --> 00:00:10.783
- Thanks.

00:00:10.783 --> 00:00:11.750
It is. I guess.

00:00:11.750 --> 00:00:13.530
I mean, I'm older too, I have kids,

00:00:13.530 --> 00:00:15.533
so we've all gotten older.

00:00:16.490 --> 00:00:19.080
I guess maybe in terms of the timeline,

00:00:19.080 --> 00:00:24.060
it's a little funny when I
think I'm younger than someone

00:00:24.060 --> 00:00:26.494
and they're like, "Oh,
I grew up on that show

00:00:26.494 --> 00:00:28.660
and it really got me through junior high."

00:00:28.660 --> 00:00:30.390
And I'm like, "Oh.

00:00:30.390 --> 00:00:32.490
I'm much older than you. Oh, interesting."

00:00:34.360 --> 00:00:37.381
So, you know, it was a long time ago

00:00:37.381 --> 00:00:41.068
and it keeps getting longer.

00:00:41.068 --> 00:00:42.743
- Yeah, well, it's gonna.

